{
  "name": "Agency report: weekly results of every client's Argorant workspace in one sheet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Agency report: weekly results of every client's Argorant workspace in one sheet\n\n### How it works\nOne sheet for all your clients, updated every Monday. Each client branch uses that client's own Argorant credential, so their data never mixes. A branch lists the client's active campaigns, reads 7 days of results per campaign and tags each row with the client name. The rows are merged and appended to one Google Sheet: date, client, campaign, sent, replies, reply rate, positive replies and bounce rate. The template has two client branches; copy a branch for each additional client and connect it to the merge.\n\nNo credits are used.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add one **Argorant API** credential per client (each client's key from their Argorant Settings, API keys) and pick it in that client's two nodes.\n3. Set each client's name in its **Name client** node.\n4. Create a sheet with the columns date, client, campaign, sent, replies, reply_rate, positive, bounce_rate and pick it in **Append to the report**.\n5. Activate.\n\n### Customization\nAdd a team chat summary, or a column with the credits left (Account > Get).",
        "height": 653,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "79b376dc-778f-4f55-8b2b-8387a45d64d6",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
